dynamia-remix adapts ideas from replica-skill by Jake Schincariol
(https://github.com/Jakeschincariol/replica-skill), MIT License,
Copyright (c) Jake Schincariol.

What was taken: the workflow idea (map an app, rebuild it clean-room, score
parity, read user reviews for gaps, sweep for leftovers of the original) and the
feature matrix columns. What changed: the skills, the three scripts
(remix-parity, remix-voice, remix-sweep) and all text were written from scratch
and reduced from eleven skills to six; design, test, launch and deploy are left
to other plugins.
